<br>
$cssDesc[Helping Veh-Veh will take up the rest of the day.]
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
    "<!--A-->\"Yes, I am offering. What do you need me to do?\"", "yes",
    "<!--B-->\"No...\"", "no",
))
<br>

<!--no-->
[
You awkwardly explain that you were merely inquiring about her needs to confirm an observation, and that you have other obligations indeterminably soon, obligations which you cannot withdraw from, and that your stomach is starting to act up.
<br>
_line["Aw... I understand,"] Veh-Veh covers her face, embarrassed. _line["Apologies, I was overeager. It would have been great if someone could watch the children for me while I ran the rest of my itinerary. But I understand that you're busy. I didn't mean to impose."]
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
